
metadata:
  book_id: "musnad-umar-abdul-aziz"
  book_name: "Musnad Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz"
  total_hadiths: "97"
  available_languages: "ar,en,ur"
  intro: "The Musnad of Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (d. 101 AH), the Umayyad caliph renowned for his justice and piety, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ar: "مسند عمر بن عبد العزيز (ت 101هـ)، الخليفة الأموي المشهور بعدله وتقواه، يجمع مروياته عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم. يُعرض هنا في 97 حديثا بالعربية والإنجليزية والأردية."
  intro_en: "The Musnad of Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (d. 101 AH), the Umayyad caliph renowned for his justice and piety, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ur: "مسند عمر بن عبدالعزیز (م 101ھ)، عدل و تقویٰ کے لیے مشہور اموی خلیفہ، ان کی نبی کریم صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم سے مروی روایات کا مجموعہ ہے۔ یہاں 97 احادیث عربی، انگریزی اور اردو کے ساتھ پیش ہیں۔"
  intro_bn: "The Musnad of Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (d. 101 AH), the Umayyad caliph renowned for his justice and piety, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_fr: "The Musnad of Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (d. 101 AH), the Umayyad caliph renowned for his justice and piety, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
