  intro_id: "The Musnad of Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (d. 101 AH), the Umayyad caliph renowned for his justice and piety, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_roman-ur: "The Musnad of Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (d. 101 AH), the Umayyad caliph renowned for his justice and piety, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ru: "The Musnad of Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (d. 101 AH), the Umayyad caliph renowned for his justice and piety, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ta: "The Musnad of Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (d. 101 AH), the Umayyad caliph renowned for his justice and piety, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
